# Denylist: nothing below may reach a build context (secrets, local state, build and test output).
.git
.github
.ai
.claude
.agents
.devcontainer
docs
.pnpm-store
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/*.tsbuildinfo
**/coverage
**/reports
**/playwright-report
**/blob-report
**/test-results
**/.stryker-tmp
**/.lighthouseci
# Environment files anywhere (Vite would inline VITE_* values into the bundle).
**/.env
**/.env.*
secrets/
.DS_Store
**/.playwright-mcp
